<title>USA: UNIDYNE gets Nasdaq listing.</title>
<headline>UNIDYNE gets Nasdaq listing.</headline>
<dateline>EXTON, Penn. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>UNIDYNE Corp said Thursday its stock will start trading on Nasdaq's small-cap market June 23.</p>
<p>UNIDYNE said it would retain its current ticker symbol on Nasdaq.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
